# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal engineering, governance and automation sources.
# These files stay in Git but must never be uploaded as public client-side
# static assets (assets.directory = "." publishes the repository root).
#
# Excluding a path here only stops the static-asset upload. The Worker itself
# is still deployed from `main = "workers/site-router.mjs"` in wrangler.toml,
# exactly as documented for .assetsignore (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/binding/#ignoring-assets).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.assetsignore
.gitignore
AGENTS.md
README.md
FOUNDATION_AUDIT_REPORT.md
FOUNDATION_FIX_REPORT.md
serve.json
wrangler.toml
package.json
package-lock.json
docs/
docs/**
research/
research/**
scripts/
scripts/**
tests/
tests/**
workers/
workers/**
# Exact-file publication carve-out: an internal text extraction artifact that
# happens to live next to the real catalogue PDF. The pdf/ directory itself
# stays public; only this intermediate file stops being uploaded.
pdf/extracted.txt